<title>FRANCE: French National Assembly group to look at banking.</title>
<headline>French National Assembly group to look at banking.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French National Assembly decided on Tuesday to create a cross-party group to look at the banking sector.</p>
<p>The group, set up on a proposal by the RPR senior party in the coalition, will have 18 RPR representatives, 14 from the UDF junior coalition partner, four Socialists, two Communists and two others.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
